  "answer": "This has been reported before: an open dropdown in Terminal's Settings page (e.g. Startup > Default profile) scrolls away from its control and out of the Terminal window when you scroll the page. It was first tracked in terminal#9320, a WinUI combo box bug, and was fixed in Terminal Preview 1.10/1.11 via #10922. It regressed in Preview in January 2024 (terminal#16629), probably from a change in #16261 that dropped an event handler, and it was still reported on 1.23 in May 2025. The tickets give no fix or confirmed workaround for your version (1.24). Until it is fixed, close the dropdown (pick an item or press Esc) before scrolling the settings page, or maximize the window so the dropdown stays on screen. Add a thumbs-up and your version details to terminal#16629 or terminal#9320 so it gets prioritized."
